  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed development, by reason of its excessive size and detailed design, would result in harm to the living conditions of the adjoining occupiers at No.17 Denver Road, (and No.13 should the approved extension not be built out), through a loss of light and outlook and would have an overbearing impact. As such, the proposals would fail to comply with policy D6 (Housing quality and standards) of the London Plan (2021) and policies LP1 (Design Quality and Local Character) and LP2 (Development and Amenity) of\r\nthe Hackney local Plan LP33 (2020) and Hackney&#x27;s Residential Alterations and Extensions SPD (2025).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;The development, by reason of its loss of landscaping at the site and failure to provide any mitigation for this loss and any biodiversity enhancement at the site, is&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;contrary to policies LP46 (Protection and Enhancement of Green Infrastructure), and LP47 (Biodiversity and Sites of Importance of Nature Conservation) of the Hackney Local Plan (2020), and policies G1 (Green infrastructure), and G6 (Biodiversity and access to nature) of the London Plan (2021).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;The proposed development, by reason of its detailed design, size, massing, and siting, would be an unduly obtrusive and overbearing extension that would fail to be subordinate to the host building and would have an adverse impact on the character of the wider terrace. As such, the proposal is contrary to policy D3 (Optimising&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;capacity through the design-led approach)&amp;nbsp;and &lt;/span&gt;D4 (Delivering good design) of the London Plan (2021) and policies LP1 (Design Quality and Local Character) and LP17 (Housing Design Standards) of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 (2020) and Hackney&#x27;s Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD (2025).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-bf54ed5d-7fff-7a9c-ac48-c849666168a7&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
